    <panel_attributes>Colour = pattern
Orange: Facade · Green: Command
Blue: Observer
Each view sends user actions to the
controller with the matching name
(AgendaView → AgendaController, …;
VenueView/DashboardView → EventController).
The facade's collaborators in the agent and
domain layers are shown in CD0 and CD2–CD4.
